    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan Health Services and Aga Khan University have launched CoronaCheck, a new mobile app for Android and iPhone that will help Tanzanians easily and safely evaluate symptoms with an in-home screening tool and understand the next steps to looking after themselves. This app can be downloaded free of cost.",
